WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Good evening, everyone.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Did anyone feed the dog?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
[moaning]

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The train is running late again.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Where did you put the map?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
It was on the kitchen table.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Oh, crap. Damn it.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Look, the lake is frozen.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.500
Can we stop for hot chocolate?

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.000
[kissing]

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Tell me the story about the lighthouse.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Remember to call your aunt.
